<title>USA: Tracor wins $27.2 mln Air Force contract.</title>
<headline>Tracor wins $27.2 mln Air Force contract.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>GDE Systems Inc, a unit of Tracor Inc, said it won a five-year $27.2 million contract with options under the Image Product Library (IPL) program from the U.S. Air Force Material Command, Rome Laboratory, Rome, N.Y.</p>
<p>Under the contract, GDE Systems will provide imagery and imagery products archives in support of tactical users.</p>
